Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.48,Short,,0,0,0,,Your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:01.16,Short,,0,0,0,,looks you dead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:01.80,Short,,0,0,0,,in the eye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:02.44,Short,,0,0,0,,and slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.44,0:00:03.56,Short,,0,0,0,,pushes your glass
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:04.76,Short,,0,0,0,,off the table
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.76,0:00:05.38,Short,,0,0,0,,You see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:06.20,Short,,0,0,0,,cats are hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.04,Short,,0,0,0,,and they test
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:07.64,Short,,0,0,0,,things with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.64,0:00:08.48,Short,,0,0,0,,their paws
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.48,0:00:09.00,Short,,0,0,0,,tapping them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:09.40,Short,,0,0,0,,to see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:10.58,Short,,0,0,0,,if they run
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:10.92,Short,,0,0,0,,So when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:12.00,Short,,0,0,0,,the glass falls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:12.48,Short,,0,0,0,,that sudden
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.40,Short,,0,0,0,,movement fires
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:14.50,Short,,0,0,0,,the same instinct
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.10,Short,,0,0,0,,as chasing prey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:16.54,Short,,0,0,0,,But there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:17.76,Short,,0,0,0,,another reason
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:18.38,Short,,0,0,0,,The first time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.38,0:00:19.14,Short,,0,0,0,,it crashed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:19.66,Short,,0,0,0,,you gasped
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:20.54,Short,,0,0,0,,and came running
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.34,Short,,0,0,0,,and your cat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:21.86,Short,,0,0,0,,learned it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.86,0:00:22.80,Short,,0,0,0,,the fastest way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:23.16,Short,,0,0,0,,to get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.32,Short,,0,0,0,,your attention
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:25.32,Short,,0,0,0,,In one study
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:25.66,Short,,0,0,0,,half of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:26.06,Short,,0,0,0,,the cats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:26.74,Short,,0,0,0,,picked time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.74,0:00:27.38,Short,,0,0,0,,with a human
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.06,Short,,0,0,0,,over food
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:29.04,Short,,0,0,0,,and toys
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:29.70,Short,,0,0,0,,So the more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:30.66,Short,,0,0,0,,you react
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:31.60,Short,,0,0,0,,the more often
